ectors 0 divergences, 13 structural checks 0 divergences; the absent-toolchain run still exits 0 and now still runs all 68 vectors. Policy object gains const feature_audit=root-all-features and source_closure=manager-prewalk-v1; three new diagnostics; conformance inventory 87 -> 134 vectors. NO NEW BOARD ELEMENT IS CREATED: the four fixes add implementation obligations to the already-linked TASK-260728-q283m8/13ioo0/2yxdo7/gjxj1v and schema obligations to TASK-260728-251p01, so creating elements would be decomposition for symmetry rather than for a requirement. Gates: probe gofmt/vet/build/test 0, probe runs 0, curator build/vet/test 0 and gofmt 0 files outside .temp; make check exit 2 and spec validate.py exit 1 are expected-red and fully attributed to other tasks scratch trees, with a clean-tree validate baseline at 0 and a scoped link check over the two authored documents at 0 broken of 4; golangci-lint NOT RUN, not installed on this host. Full evidence: TASK-260728-12pnm1_results.md and TASK-260728-12pnm1_rework-cycle-2-measurements.md.
